 "topic": "Vice City portal Easter egg (solved Nov 2026 by YouTuber Memeio): in Key Lento climb the Badger radio tower and flip the power switch (Malibu Club logo on the TV); visit all 12 LPL substations without fast travel; their letters spell the old Vice City cheat LIFE IS PASSING ME BY; between 7 PM and 6 AM go to Reactor Two at Turtle Head power station; a portal leads to the PS2-era Malibu Club; reward Tommy Vercetti's shirt and bike",
